gainst the implemented\n  reporting backend, admin view, and validation findings, and any review\n  findings are addressed.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-4 (P2): documentation covers report semantics (what counts as a\n  GPU-hour) and export integration.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Priority derived from the strategy's `priority: Major` (docs-authoring\n  priority exception): P1. Report semantics content must reflect the metering\n  consumption contract and the Distributed Workloads team's validated quota\n  attribution, hence the dependency on all implementation epics.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44912,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8dee8d39a363c00d","agent_id":"ae32d1b8c5297bda1","session_id":"2c7f7242-e955-423b-a303-ec17bb0be124","uuid":"833a51c5-1d78-434b-bc87-fef60c61fbd3","timestamp":"2026-10-26T11:30:25.367Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9018 into epics"}
