{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-96ea0b691c0e18cd","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9018-E003\n3\ttitle: Dashboard admin view for GPU chargeback reports and Kueue quota comparison\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9018\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9018-E002\n11\tai_signals:\n12\t  change_specificity: 0\n13\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n14\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n15\t  existing_foundation: 1\n16\t  open_questions: 0\n17\t  external_dependency: 0\n18\t  human_process_gates: 0\n19\t  repo_access: 1\n20\t  architecture_claims: 1\n21\timplementation_type: null\n22\tinvestigation_signals: null\n23\tai_implementability: High\n24\tai_implementability_score: 4\n25\tjira_key: null\n26\tbranch: null\n27\tgated_by: null\n28\tgate_failure_impact: null\n29\t---\n30\t# Dashboard admin view for GPU chargeback reports and Kueue quota comparison\n31\t\n32\t## Description\n33\t\n34\tThis epic delivers the administrator-facing Dashboard view for GPU chargeback\n35\treporting: per-project GPU-hour consumption reports over selectable time\n36\tranges, and the current-month consumption of each project shown against its\n37\tKueue quota. It builds against the report data and API contract delivered by\n38\tthe reporting backend. The view is restricted to platform administrators.\n39\t\n40\t## Scope\n41\t\n42\t- Admin view listing per-project GPU-hour consumption with admin-selectable\n43\t  time ranges, rendered from the reporting backend's report data.\n44\t- Current-month (month-to-date) consumption displayed against each project's\n45\t  Kueue quota (ClusterQueue/LocalQueue quota model), with the quota\n46\t  attribution rules the view applies documented for validation by the\n47\t  Distributed Workloads team.\n48\t- Administrator-only visibility of the chargeback view, consistent with the\n49\t  Dashboard's OpenShift OAuth / RBAC model.\n50\t- Report export entry point (CSV) surfaced in the admin view, using the\n51\t  backend's export capability.\n52\t\n53\t## Acceptance Criteria\n54\t\n55\t- An administrator can select a time range and see per-project GPU-hour\n56\t  consumption for that range, matching the reporting backend's figures for the\n57\t  same range.\n58\t- The view shows each project's current-month consumption alongside its Kueue\n59\t  quota, and the quota attribution rules used (which queue-level quota is\n60\t  attributed to which project) are documented.\n61\t- The chargeback view is not visible to non-administrator users.\n62\t- CSV export of the displayed report is available from the admin view and\n63\t  round-trips the same figures.\n64\t\n65\t## HLR Traceability\n66\t\n67\t- HLR-1 (P0): the administrator-facing presentation of per-project GPU-hour\n68\t  consumption reports over selectable time ranges.\n69\t- HLR-3 (P1, bundled): current-month consumption against each project's Kueue\n70\t  quota — bundled with HLR-1 because it renders in the same admin view, same\n71\t  per-project rows, and same report-data fetch path; a separate epic would\n72\t  rebuild the same UI surface.\n73\t\n74\t## Notes\n75\t\n76\t- Distributed Workloads requires no code change for this view; its quota model\n77\t  is consumed read-only. The quota attribution implemented here is validated\n78\t  by the Distributed Workloads team as a follow-on validation epic, which this\n79\t  view supports by documenting its attribution rules.\n80\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a85c2b9d083d1e57","agent_id":"a03579676fb753c67","session_id":"2c7f7242-e955-423b-a303-ec17bb0be124","uuid":"adb83582-9de9-4a5a-925f-bfe0d5d97d58","timestamp":"2026-10-26T11:31:46.965Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-96ea0b691c0e18cd","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9018 decomposition